			four == "LENGTH\n4 BARS" and looper.length_key.legend.text == "LENGTH\n1 BAR" and looper.length == 1
			and studio.looper_length == 1 and looper.length_key.readout().contains("1 bar"))
	# Stopped in the middle of bar 5 (8.7 s).
